# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# bnc.part -- A machined block that holds six BNC connectors
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# Machined 6061-T6 aluminium; holds six BNCs, each in a 3/8-32 UNEF
# tapped hole through a boss on the bottom face, countersunk at the boss.
# Between each pair of BNCs, a 4-40 tapped hole runs through the block,
# countersunk at the bottom face, and a blind 4-40 tapped hole with a
# drill point enters the -y face.  Tapped holes are drawn at the tap
# drill.  The frame is the one of the Creo part: the block runs along x
# from its -x end, the BNC axes along -z.  Build it with
#   extrude test/bnc.part | bool - | tostep - > bnc.step

N = 6
PITCH = 0.8 in
END = 0.25 in
X0 = -55.5625
Y0 = 1.5748
Y1 = Y0 + 0.617 in
YB = Y0 + 0.317 in
Z0 = -29.3243
Z1 = Z0 + 0.325 in
BOSS = 0.5 in
BOSS_H = 0.05 in
TAP = 0.332 in
TAP_CS = 0.39 in
TAP4 = 0.089 in
TAP4_CS = 0.11 in
CS = 41
BLIND = 0.23 in
BLIND_Z = Z0 + 0.17 in
POINT = 118

L = 2 * END + (N - 1) * PITCH
N_M = N / 2
P_M = 2 * PITCH
XB = X0 + END
XM = XB + PITCH / 2
ZB = Z0 - BOSS_H
H_CS = (TAP_CS - TAP) / 2 / tan(CS)
H_CS4 = (TAP4_CS - TAP4) / 2 / tan(CS)
H_POINT = TAP4 / 2 / tan(POINT / 2)

profile outline along z X0 Y0 0 X0+L Y0 0 X0+L Y1 0 X0 Y1 0
extrude block from Z0 to Z1 outline

circle boss along z XB YB BOSS
extrude bosses from ZB to Z0 boss pattern +x N PITCH
union body block bosses

circle tap along z XB YB TAP
circle tap_cs along z XB YB TAP_CS
extrude taps from ZB to Z1 tap pattern +x N PITCH
extrude tap_sinks from ZB to ZB+H_CS tap_cs draft CS pattern +x N PITCH

circle m4 along z XM YB TAP4
circle m4_cs along z XM YB TAP4_CS
extrude m4s from Z0 to Z1 m4 pattern +x N_M P_M
extrude m4_sinks from Z0 to Z0+H_CS4 m4_cs draft CS pattern +x N_M P_M

circle blind along y XM BLIND_Z TAP4
circle blind_cs along y XM BLIND_Z TAP4_CS
extrude blinds from Y0 to Y0+BLIND blind pattern +x N_M P_M
extrude blind_sinks from Y0 to Y0+H_CS4 blind_cs draft CS pattern +x N_M P_M
Y_POINT = Y0 + BLIND
Y_END = Y_POINT + H_POINT
extrude points from Y_POINT to Y_END blind draft POINT/2 pattern +x N_M P_M

cut bnc body taps tap_sinks m4s m4_sinks blinds blind_sinks points
